[E0423] Error: a top-level `val` cannot hold what owns memory
   ╭─[ err/177_constant_tables/main.wip:5:31 ]
   │
 5 │ val BOXED: Option<own<i64>> = .None
   │                               ──┬──  
   │                                 ╰──── `Option<own<i64>>` owns memory
